; Somebody else, as three tracked things.
;
; A head and two hands is the whole avatar, which is what the article synchronises and what the
; service publishes: `class_owner` says whose, `sub_index` says which. There is no body between
; them because nothing on the wire describes one, and inventing a torso here would be this
; client guessing at a pose the service never sent.
